{"id": "86073", "name": "אינטגרל לא מסוים של tan²(kt) – בעזרת sec² (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find</p><p>Hint: Use a trigonometric identity and note that the derivative of \\(\\tan(t)\\) is \\(\\sec^2(t)\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int {{CT:0}}\\,d{{CT:1}} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Replace \\(\\tan^2\\) by \\(\\sec^2-1\\); the derivative of \\(\\tan\\) is \\(\\sec^2\\), so both terms integrate directly.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The identity</b><br><p>Divide \\(\\sin^2 A+\\cos^2 A=1\\) by \\(\\cos^2 A\\): \\(\\tan^2 A=\\sec^2 A-1\\). With \\(A={{CT:2}}\\):</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} = {{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Integrate</b><br><p>Since \\(\\frac{d}{d{{CT:1}}}\\tan({{CT:2}})={{CT:4}}\\sec^2({{CT:2}})\\), an antiderivative of \\({{CT:5}}\\) is \\(\\frac{1}{{CT:4}}\\tan({{CT:2}})\\). Hence</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int {{CT:0}}\\,d{{CT:1}} = \\int {{CT:5}}\\,d{{CT:1}} - \\int 1\\,d{{CT:1}} = {{CT:6}} + C \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Int", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "int(q,v)+c", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "q", "q1", "q2", "rdm", "v"], "nvariants": 5}